 food allergies. It can occur at any age and is characterized by severe gastrointestinal symptoms. A key feature of this condition is the presence of eosinophils in gastric or intestinal biopsies, which helps in its diagnosis."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}